	(text "Monitoring, not diagnosis. Battery power only while a person touches the electrodes; never test on anyone with a pacemaker or ICD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 419.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dc9354c8-e5ac-45cd-a4af-95e683c03cb6"))
	(text "Z = R5 x V(body) / V(R5): the gain cancels. Paths (S1 S0): 00 legs, 01 arms, 10 right side, 11 left side. Trunk = (Z3 + Z4 - Z1 - Z2) / 2." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 424.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "39ac9243-4af1-4c6d-88c0-5992b2e03718"))
	(text "R8/R9 = 10 Mohm (LTspice Monte Carlo: 1 Mohm gave up to 12 % error). Firmware reads the 5 kHz Goertzel amplitude, never peak-to-peak (mains hum)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 429.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "19833824-b8cd-4fec-97a9-82534031daaa"))
	(text "Pin-compatible symbols: INA128 symbol used for INA126, CD4052B/CD4053B for 74HC4052/74HC4053, LM2904 for MCP6002." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 434.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7d2722ca-6a8e-40bf-a103-a81bfba4255b"))
